_exptl_absorpt_special_details
;
 X-ray diffraction analyses were performed on single crystals coated with
 Paratone-N oil and mounted on MiTeGen loops. Crystals kept at a temperature of 298 K 
by an Oxford Cryosystems Cyrostream using N2 during
 the experiments. Data was collected at Beamline 11.3.1 at the Advanced
 Light Source, Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory using synchrotron
 radiation (lamda = 0.7749 angstroms) and a Bruker PHOTON100 CMOS diffractometer.
;
